      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I can report very similar issues. Started a few weeks ago and has been progressively getting worse, from a few disconnects/night to every few minutes like OP.\n\nNetwork connection is otherwise stable, no other connectivity issues. I can even ping the vrchat APIs while timed out. I have tried alternative DNS servers, disabling ipv6, disabling dns level ad filtering, verifying game integrity, and clearing vrchat caches.\n\nIt does seem to be something specifically with the photon network layer",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
