  "details": "2025.05.02 11:51:11 Error      -  Connection lost. OnStatusChanged to TimeoutDisconnect. Client state was: ConnectingToMasterserver. SCS v0 UDP SocketErrorCode: 0 AppOutOfFocus WinSock\n\n2025.05.02 11:51:11 Error      -  [Behaviour] {{ NameServerAddress: 'ns.photonengine.io:5058', MasterServerAddress: 'GCAMS1160.exitgames.com:5055', GameServerAddress: '80.93.214.15:5056', Code: 'ClientTimeout', State: 'Disconnected', Time: '0' }}\n\n2025.05.02 11:51:11 Error      -  [Behaviour] Timeout: Your connection to VRChat timed out. Verify connection and try again.\n\n2025.05.02 12:17:33 Error      -  [NetworkTransport] Failed to raise deferred operation of type 10.\n\n2025.05.02 12:17:33 Error      -  [NetworkTransport] Failed to raise deferred operation of type 10.\n\nI've pulled out all of my hairs trying to solve this issue. I've restarted my modem, I've restarted my router, I've swapped DNS servers. I've connected my PC directly to the internet. There seems to be an issue with the photon hosting service or Photon engine dropping the connection to my client.\n\nWhenever this happens, I'll get the error VRChat is not responding.\n\nThis issue only began happening approximately 2 weeks ago.",
